# INVWINRE.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the item listing
# of sixty-three items printed on Windows' default printer, on pages of
# the length the settings start with, its Output turned from SCREEN, the
# first offered, to PRINTER, and the box that says it is done; the end
# by Exit.  The listing ends its first page in the items of Box B2 and
# gives the second the header again, its page number and the group's
# heading as continued.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINRE.SNP is its snapshot, and
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINRE.PRN what the test machine's printer, Generic /
# Text Only on a file, prints.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-R I ALT-O DOWN
K ENTER
S PRINTED
K ENTER ESC
K ALT-F X
